# Extra gems for redmine_expert_agile.
#
# Redmine loads plugins/*/{Gemfile,PluginGemfile} automatically. The plugin
# deliberately has no runtime dependencies: charts use a vendored Chart.js
# build under assets/javascripts, and drag & drop uses the jQuery UI that
# Redmine core already ships. Nothing to declare yet — the file exists so the
# convention is visible and a dependency can be added without ceremony.
